{"name":"-68-A-22","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"569","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_2022_Summer_AVG_2","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...The Lake of Cognition. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Everything in this space is as ephemeral as sunlight reflected by a large sapphire. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"White petals of a marguerite daisy drift on the water, soaking in the sunlight and giving off a pale glimmer. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sana has reverted to her original state..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why... give me hope... then plunge me back into despair...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"False hope can't save you. Sometimes, only true despair can set you free..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sana","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Liar... Liar..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":27,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Goodbye, Sana."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bubble","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Amidst the girls' singing, Sana dissolves into bubbles, rising slowly from the bottom of the lake... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Until they reach the surface and feel the first ray of sunlight shining upon them from the sky. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The endless stretch of blue starts fading..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Erma..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've decided..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Don't tell me you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, Reinette. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't want to forget anymore... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I must return to Her Majesty the King and complete our common mission together."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And after that...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There is no after."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You'll be gone, won't you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":25,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The two Dolls grip each other's hands. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Reinette closes her eyes to hold back her tears."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I didn't want any of this to happen... This isn't how I want it to end. Erma..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":26,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm so tired... Reinette. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I've been trying so hard... pretending to be strong, to be brave... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I... am just a weak little kid. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm supposed to be the elder sister, but I keep taking my anger out on you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...That's not true, Erma... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't hate you at all... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I... I know I can say some pretty mean things, but I really missed you, and Mirabelle, and every sister in the Summer Garden. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I even missed Natalie and the Doctor... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"When I was serving in the military, there wasn't a day when I didn't want to come home... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then I finally got the chance to contact you... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You have no idea how happy I was when I was finally given permission to make contact with you... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Erma... It was me that brought you here... I can't even begin to tell you how sorry I am..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Erma lets go of Reinette's hands and gives her a cheeky smile that feels so very familiar to Reinette."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":26,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'll let you in on a secret."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":26,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've recorded a few videos for AR-18. I want you to deliver them to her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I was totally gossiping about you in the recordings."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not doing this. You—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":26,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hush."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Erma presses her index finger against her lips. Reinette suddenly finds that she is unable to speak or move."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":26,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oops, I just remembered how to use my authorizations. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry, but you're not arguing with me this time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Reinette","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":26,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,155"}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.4","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's go see the King together, Reinette."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreen","raw":"白屏1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bubble","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"183","